# Articles the guided tour and the golden-path e2e walk publish for real.
# They carry the run token that scripts/demo-clean.ts sweeps on, and they are
# artifacts of a run rather than knowledge anyone curated -- twice now they
# have been swept into a commit by a `git add -A` after an e2e run.
knowledge-base/**/*ref-henry*.md
knowledge-base/**/*ref-grommet*.md
